  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to Climate Resilient Education Systems Trial (CREST).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to Climate Resilient Education Systems Trial (CREST). The UK is working with the International Rescue Committee (IRC) to develop CREST, which will be the first parametric insurance pilot which aims to ensure the continuity of education during a crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
